@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Iniciar sesión como administrador
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### Actualizar completamente un registro de inventario
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/inventarios/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "ubicacion_id": 1,
  "item_id": 1,
  "cantidad": 25,
  "stock_minimo": 5
}

###

### Actualizar parcialmente la cantidad
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/inventarios/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "cantidad": 30
}
